---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`关于 - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="关于 Reynor 与这个个人知识博客。" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="about">
			<section class="about-intro" aria-labelledby="about-title">
				<div class="about-copy">
					<h1 id="about-title">关于我与这片<br />小小的记录地<span>。</span></h1>
					<div class="about-text">
						<p>我是 Reynor，一名嵌入式开发者，长期专注于嵌入式系统、Linux 多媒体、摄像头驱动与图像处理。</p>
						<p>这里记录我在工程实践中遇到的问题、思考的路径与解决的过程，也包括那些绕路、试错与反复验证的时刻。</p>
						<p>我希望留下的不只是结论，而是问题如何被理解、如何被拆解，以及在复杂约束下，如何一步步找到可行的答案。</p>
					</div>
					<nav class="about-links" aria-label="联系与订阅">
						<a href="https://github.com/Reynor-0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub <span>↗</span></a>
						<a href="/rss.xml">RSS <span>↗</span></a>
					</nav>
				</div>

				<aside class="identity" aria-label="个人简介">
					<div class="identity-art" aria-hidden="true">
						<span>R</span>
					</div>
					<p>写代码，也写下为什么这样写。</p>
					<p>让复杂的技术，被时间打磨得更清晰。</p>
				</aside>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about {
		display: grid;
		min-height: calc(100svh - 160px);
		place-items: center;
		padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 120px) 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 8% 18%, rgba(134, 169, 212, 0.16), transparent 26rem),
			radial-gradient(circle at 91% 80%, rgba(239, 191, 210, 0.15), transparent 25rem),
			var(--paper);
	}

	.about-intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 0.68fr);
		align-items: center;
		width: min(100% - 48px, 1060px);
		gap: clamp(48px, 8vw, 100px);
	}

	.about h1 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: var(--heading);
		font-family: Georgia, "Noto Serif SC", "Songti SC", serif;
		font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.6vw, 4.8rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.055em;
		line-height: 1.14;
	}

	.about h1 span {
		color: var(--pink);
	}

	.about-text {
		display: grid;
		max-width: 680px;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.about-text p {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgb(var(--muted));
		font-size: 0.98rem;
		line-height: 1.95;
	}

	.about-links {
		display: flex;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.about-links a {
		padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent), 0.42);
		color: var(--accent-strong);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.about-links a:hover {
		border-color: var(--pink);
		color: #bd6689;
	}

	.identity {
		padding: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line), 0.72);
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: rgba(var(--card), 0.72);
		box-shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(76, 103, 137, 0.09);
		backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
	}

	.identity-art {
		position: relative;
		display: grid;
		width: 152px;
		height: 152px;
		margin-bottom: 1.7rem;
		place-items: center;
		border-radius: 46% 54% 58% 42% / 45% 40% 60% 55%;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 68% 28%, rgba(247, 204, 221, 0.9), transparent 27%),
			radial-gradient(circle at 34% 72%, rgba(163, 195, 229, 0.78), transparent 44%),
			linear-gradient(145deg, #eaf4fd, #c9dcef 54%, #f8e5ee);
		box-shadow:
			18px 16px 0 rgba(239, 191, 210, 0.16),
			-13px 12px 0 rgba(134, 169, 212, 0.1);
	}

	.identity-art span {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: 3.9rem;
		text-shadow: 0 3px 18px rgba(86, 120, 158, 0.24);
	}

	.identity > p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--heading-soft);
		font-family: Georgia, "Noto Serif SC", "Songti SC", serif;
		font-size: 0.94rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.identity > p + p {
		color: rgb(var(--muted));
	}

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.about {
			padding: 58px 0 72px;
		}

		.about-intro {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			width: min(100% - 28px, 1060px);
			gap: 42px;
		}

		.about h1 {
			font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 12vw, 4rem);
		}

		.identity {
			padding: 1.6rem;
		}
	}
</style>
